# Social app layout shell

## Page width and spacing (desktop)

- **Max width:** `max-w-[1280px]` on the main content column and header inner row (`mx-auto w-full`).
- **Top padding (below header):** `pt-6` (24px) on the primary scrollable/main wrapper.
- **Horizontal padding:** `lg:px-[60px]` on desktop; below `sm`, use **`px-5`** (20px) with **`sm:px-6`** so mobile matches the 20px side inset.

Apply the same horizontal padding to the sticky header inner row so header and body align.

## Brand color (Infinity-Primary)

- **`#3D4C6E`** — defined in [`apps/social/src/app/globals.css`](apps/social/src/app/globals.css) as `--infinity-primary` (comment: Infinity-Primary) and mapped in `@theme inline` as **`--color-infinity-primary`**. Tailwind utilities: `bg-infinity-primary`, `text-infinity-primary`, etc.

## Background

- Site canvas: **`#F9FAFF`** — set as `--background` in `apps/social/src/app/globals.css` and exposed to Tailwind as `bg-background` (see `@theme inline` there). Use `bg-background` / `bg-background/90` for body and sticky header so the tone stays consistent.

## Mobile bottom navigation

- [`apps/social/src/components/MobileBottomNav.tsx`](apps/social/src/components/MobileBottomNav.tsx) — rendered from [`apps/social/src/app/layout.tsx`](apps/social/src/app/layout.tsx); **`lg:hidden`**. **20px** horizontal inset from the screen (`mx-5` on the inner wrapper). Bar: **`rounded-[20px]`**, white, `shadow-[0_4px_19px_rgba(57,57,57,0.05)]`, padding **`pt-[10px] px-[30px] pb-[5px]`**, inner row **`h-16`**, **`justify-between`**, **`gap-[33px]`**, **`dir="ltr"`** (Bookmark → Profile → center → Search → Home). Side tabs are **`Link`**s to **`/bookmarks`**, **`/profile`**, **`/search`**, **`/`** (home); **`usePathname()`** (normalized) drives **active** icon + indicator (**`text-infinity-primary`** / **`bg-infinity-primary`**) for the current route. Tab slots: **`h-8 w-6`**, **`gap-2`**, Lucide icons **24×24**, **`strokeWidth={1.5}`**; inactive strokes **`#A3A3A3`** / profile **`#A49BA0`**; indicator **`h-[3px] w-[17px]`**, inactive **`bg-black/[0.08]`**. Center: **`size-16`** circle **`bg-infinity-primary`**, mark from **[`/Infinity.svg`](apps/social/public/Infinity.svg)** (~**49×49**), also links **`/`** (no tab indicator; home tab shows active on `/`). **`pb-[env(safe-area-inset-bottom)]`** on the fixed wrapper; **`body`** uses **`pb-28 lg:pb-0`** so content clears the bar. Placeholder shells: [`bookmarks/page.tsx`](apps/social/src/app/bookmarks/page.tsx), [`profile/page.tsx`](apps/social/src/app/profile/page.tsx), [`search/page.tsx`](apps/social/src/app/search/page.tsx).

## Top header

- [`apps/social/src/components/Header.tsx`](apps/social/src/components/Header.tsx) — **`lg` and up:** same canvas as the app (`bg-background/90`, backdrop blur); LTR grid — [`SearchBar`](apps/social/src/components/SearchBar.tsx) (Figma `Frame 92960`), centered **`StorefrontLogo`** **`92×58`**, bookmarks / notifications / profile. **`lg:hidden` mobile:** background **`#F8F9FB`**; same **`StorefrontLogo`** asset **smaller** (**`72×45`**); notifications only in **`rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-sm`** bell control; logo uses **`absolute` centering** + **`pointer-events`** so the bell stays clickable. Keep [`apps/social/public/images/full-logo.png`](apps/social/public/images/full-logo.png) in sync with the storefront asset.

## Typography

- Persian UI uses shared **`@repo/fonts`** (Peyda Fanum on `<body>`, variables on `<html>`). See [repo-fonts-package.mdc](repo-fonts-package.mdc).

### Resolving `@repo/fonts`

- Run **`pnpm install`** from the monorepo root so `apps/social/node_modules/@repo/fonts` exists. If the IDE or an old dev server still errors, restart dev. [`apps/social/tsconfig.json`](apps/social/tsconfig.json) also maps `@repo/fonts` → `../../packages/fonts/src/index.ts` as a fallback.

## Direction and language

- Root layout uses `lang="fa"` and `dir="rtl"` for Persian UI copy.

## Icons

- Same packages as storefront: **`lucide-react@0.542.0`** (primary) and **`react-icons@5.5.0`** (Feather / MD / etc. when needed). Declare them in [`apps/social/package.json`](apps/social/package.json) at those versions to stay aligned with `@repo/frontend`.

## Stories rail

- **Layout (Figma Frame 92985 / 92964):** [`stories-rail.tsx`](apps/social/src/components/stories-rail.tsx) — column `items-end`, **gap 20px** (`gap-5`), **padding 0**. Heading **داستان ها**: **24px / 700 / line-height 21px**, `#424242`, `font-peyda`. Row **h-20**, **gap 16px** (`gap-4`). Avatars **80×80** outer, **74×74** image: unseen **3px** gradient ring `to-b #3C4D6E → #98BDFF`; seen **`border-2` `#C3C3C3`**. No per-story captions in rail (spec); `aria-label` on each control.
- **Parity vs storefront:** Same **npm** viewer **`react-instagram-stories@1.1.1`** (declared in [`apps/social/package.json`](apps/social/package.json)), same **API** (`getActiveStories`, seen endpoints, `@repo/api` URLs). The viewer **must** load the library stylesheet: `@import "react-instagram-stories/styles.css"` in [`apps/social/src/app/globals.css`](apps/social/src/app/globals.css) (resolved from `node_modules`, never copy `node_modules` into the repo). **Not** shared React components with storefront — only the same package + import pattern. If behavior diverges, check env (`NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL`, tokens), auth, and network.
- Supporting: [`stories-avatar-list.tsx`](apps/social/src/components/stories/stories-avatar-list.tsx), [`story.service.ts`](apps/social/src/services/story.service.ts), [`stories-viewer-modal.tsx`](apps/social/src/components/stories/stories-viewer-modal.tsx).

## UI primitives

- **Button:** [`apps/social/src/components/ui/Button.tsx`](apps/social/src/components/ui/Button.tsx) — default variant matches the glass gradient profile pill (Figma `Frame 92963`); pass glyphs via the optional `icon` prop (`ReactNode`).

## Conventions

- Prefer **Next.js `Link`** for internal routes (`href` starting with `/`); use `<a>` for hash/placeholder anchors until routes exist.
- New routes should keep content inside the same `max-w-[1280px]` + horizontal padding pattern for visual consistency.
